// Regla Sigma: proc_creation_win_powershell_frombase64string_archive.yml
// ID Sigma: d75d6b6b-adb9-48f7-824b-ac2e786efe1f
// Título: Suspicious FromBase64String Usage On Gzip Archive - Process Creation
// Descripción: Detects attempts of decoding a base64 Gzip archive via PowerShell. This technique is often used as a method to load malicious content into memory afterward.
// Aplica a: Producto: windows | Categoría: process_creation
// Producto: windows
// Categoría: process_creation
// Servicio: 
// Nivel: medium
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Ruta original: C:\SigmaLab\sigma\rules\windows\process_creation\proc_creation_win_powershell_frombase64string_archive.yml
// Requiere validación en el entorno de destino.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where ProcessCommandLine contains "FromBase64String" and ProcessCommandLine contains "MemoryStream" and ProcessCommandLine contains "H4sI"
